cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If kdev helped your work, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "kdev: a Kaggle notebook as your remote dev box"
abstract: >-
  A command-line tool that runs a Kaggle notebook session as a remote
  development box: SSH and VS Code in over a Cloudflare tunnel, with the
  working directory restored from the notebook's saved versions on every
  start, across Kaggle accounts and machines.
authors:
  - given-names: Tushar
    family-names: Sharma
    alias: tushar-mahalya
repository-code: https://github.com/tushar-mahalya/kdev
url: https://pypi.org/project/kdev-cli/
license: MIT
keywords:
  - kaggle
  - remote development
  - ssh
  - vscode
  - gpu
  - cloudflare tunnel
